# The build context is a whitelist: nothing reaches the image but the project file, the
# package, the API and the web page. A folder named here that is not there is skipped, so the
# build does not need web/ to exist. runs/, samples/, tests/, LEDGER.md and .env never reach it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/rlm
!app
!web
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
